# field-enter (h8-points-field): "1.5" committed with Enter — p applied,
# the field closed showing "1.50", the focus back on the slider.
# Behaviour: the URL "p=1.5", the slider aria-valuenow "1.5", the focus ring
# on the slider.
size 1440 900
density 2
scheme dark
mode dark
theme arctic-ice
wait 2000
click 293 716
wait 150
key Backspace
key Backspace
key Backspace
key Backspace
wait 100
type "1.5"
wait 100
key Enter
wait 400
shot field-enter
